@nsobid-6291E14453EE63090164E79B227113F0C24B0CB7

# Tomodachi Life: Living the Dream [010051F0207B2000] v1.0.3 - 1080p Native (no dynamic resolution)

// Pins the game at a full native 1920x1080 and disables its dynamic-resolution
// ladder, so the image never drops below native under load.  This is the game's
// native output resolution (its composite/output stage is hardwired to 1080p),
// so this mod does not raise the screenshot size -- it just holds native 1080p
// steady.  For a sharper image use the [Supersampling 1440p] / [Supersampling
// 2160p] mods, which render higher internally and downsample to this same 1080p.
//
// Native res needs no GPU-pool enlargement, so nothing here risks the
// above-native crash the old 2580x1080 mods warned about.

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

@enabled
// 1. Framework screen size (nnMain): the packed height<<32 | width the
//    GameFrameworkColony config hands to sead::GameFrameworkNx.
008fa460 08F080D2   // MOVZ X8, #1920          width
008fa464 0887C0F2   // MOVK X8, #1080,LSL#32   height
// 2. gsys::SystemTask::CreateArg main render-display size: the internal
//    3D render resolution.  This is the constant the 1.0.2 mods patch.
008e855c 09F080D2   // MOVZ X9, #1920          width
008e8564 0987C0F2   // MOVK X9, #1080,LSL#32   height
// 3. Dynamic-resolution ladder in the CreateArg constructor.  Both of its
//    two {x,y} scale sets read 1.0 / 0.8 / 0.667 by default; the 0.8 and
//    0.667 rungs are rewritten to 1.0 so the controller can never scale
//    the frame down under load.  Registers X9/X10 are dead here -- both
//    are reloaded just above these lines and only consumed by the four
//    STRs at 008e8974..008e8980 that write the ladder.
008e88d0 0AF0A7D2   // MOVZ X10,#0x3F80,LSL#16  ; X10 = 1.0f,1.0f
008e88d4 0AF0E7F2   // MOVK X10,#0x3F80,LSL#48  ;
008e88e8 09F0A7D2   // MOVZ X9, #0x3F80,LSL#16  ; X9  = 1.0f,1.0f
008e88ec 09F0E7F2   // MOVK X9, #0x3F80,LSL#48  ;
008e88f4 1F2003D5   // NOP                      ; was MOVK X9, #0xCCCD,LSL#32
008e88f8 1F2003D5   // NOP                      ; was MOVK X9, #0x3F4C,LSL#48
008e88fc 1F2003D5   // NOP                      ; was MOVK X10,#0xAAAB,LSL#32
008e8900 1F2003D5   // NOP                      ; was MOVK X10,#0x3F2A,LSL#48
@stop

// Reverse-engineered against main.i64 for 1.0.3; every offset byte-verified.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-visuen-mods